  {
    "kind": "DisplayMath",
    "text": "\nC=\\sum_{j=0}^{m-1}3^{m-1-j}2^{A_j},\\qquad\ng_p(n)=\\frac{Ln+C}{U}.\n\\tag{1}\n"
